        "original_id": "70262b37-0704-54c2-bb6c-85ca5f4693af",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Newhouse\n- Organizations: World Series of Poker, Caesars Entertainment Corporation, Harrah's Entertainment\n- Events: WSOP Main Event, poker tournaments\n- Places: Las Vegas\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Newhouse was born on March 11, 1985.\n- The World Series of Poker is a series of poker tournaments held annually in Las Vegas.\n- Since 2005, Caesars Entertainment Corporation has sponsored the World Series of Poker.\n- Harrah's Entertainment was the name of Caesars Entertainment Corporation until 2010.\n- Mark Newhouse is an American professional poker player.\n- Mark Newhouse made back-to-back final tables at the World Series of Poker Main Event in 2013 and 2014.\n- Mark Newhouse finished 9th in the World Series of Poker Main Event in both 2013 and 2014.",
